// The real Rinternals.h (lines 281 / 1139):
//   R_xlen_t (TRUELENGTH)(SEXP x);
//   R_xlen_t (XTRUELENGTH)(SEXP x);
//
// These return the allocated capacity, which may exceed the logical
// length for growable vectors.  The fake SEXPREC has no separate
// "true length" field; allocVector always allocates exactly length
// elements, so TRUELENGTH == LENGTH in the fake build.
//
// None of the four rpart CSV rows call TRUELENGTH.  It is included
